The '''Gloomlock Grimoire''' has two abilities: {{AN|Life Tap}} and {{AN|Extreme Measures}}.
* {{AN|Life Tap}} is activated on {{Yellow|'''LEFT CLICK'''}}, converting {{Stat|sf|15}} to {{Stat|overflow mana|600}}, at the cost of {{Stat|Health|800}}. It has a cooldown of {{Green|1s}}.
* {{AN|Extreme Measures}} is activated on {{Yellow|'''RIGHT CLICK'''}}, healing the player for {{Stat|hp|1,000}} at the cost of {{Stat|vitality|45}}.

